  <data name="sysparam.jitter.desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>For cumulative points (kWh, m³…), a drop within "previous value × tolerance %" is treated as reading jitter; larger drops are treated as a reset / meter replacement and the difference is summed per segment.</value></data>
